[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 362.87, "timestamp": "00:06:02", "text": "大家好。 你好。 你好。 你好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 365.909, "timestamp": "00:06:05", "text": "呃，我非常抱歉。 我在这里遇到了很大的困难。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 368.07, "timestamp": "00:06:08", "text": "呃，一心多用。  [笑声和喘息声]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 383.27, "timestamp": "00:06:23", "text": "这是我今年第一次合作，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 385.134, "timestamp": "00:06:25", "text": "但我遇到了困难。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 390.309, "timestamp": "00:06:30", "text": "好的，宝贝。 兄弟，我整个视频都卡顿了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 391.99, "timestamp": "00:06:31", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 393.99, "timestamp": "00:06:33", "text": "你好，Draganoser。 欢迎光临。您好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 395.83, "timestamp": "00:06:35", "text": "你好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 399.029, "timestamp": "00:06:39", "text": "呃，好的。 等待。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 401.749, "timestamp": "00:06:41", "text": "呃，我们这里遇到了一些技术问题"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 409.67, "timestamp": "00:06:49", "text": "嗨，迈克尔·普内斯。 等"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 413.59000000000003, "timestamp": "00:06:53", "text": "他们准备好了告诉我，然后我就会给他们看。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 419.11, "timestamp": "00:06:59", "text": "你好。 嗯，我就简单说一下。"}]